{% extends layoutTemplate %}
{# Presents the privacy policy using the appropriate public or app layout. #}

{% block title %}Trade Tank: Privacy Policy{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="main-container">
        <div class="copy copy--information">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

            <h2>Data and account security</h2>
            <p>
                In this section, we disclose the full extent of our use of user data. We do not
                collect information for use outside the services provided by Trade Tank. No
                metadata is collected from user devices beyond what may be necessary for the
                core functionality of the application's main features. Trade Tank does not sell
                user information. Passwords are not stored in their original form and are never
                shared with third parties by Trade Tank.
            </p>

            <h2>Cookies and sessions</h2>
            <p>
                Trade Tank values user privacy and transparency. Essential cookies are used to
                retain user sessions while users are logged in. IP addresses are used temporarily
                in memory for rate limiting, but are not persistently stored in the application
                database or attached to a user's profile.
            </p>
            <h2>Server and network logs</h2>
            <p>
                We plan to disable Nginx access logging to reduce the information retained
                about visits. This change has not yet been confirmed as active. Until then,
                server access logs may contain IP addresses and request details. Disabling
                access logging does not disable error logs, which may also contain IP
                addresses or request details when a problem occurs.
            </p>
            <p>
                When traffic to Trade Tank passes through Cloudflare, Cloudflare may process
                and log visitor IP addresses and request information to deliver and protect
                the service. This processing is separate from Trade Tank's application
                database and Nginx access logging settings. For more information, see
                <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
